<h2 id="deepseek-in-the-ai-era">DeepSeek in the AI Era</h2>

<p>During this year’s Spring Festival, DeepSeek really took off like sparks and lightning, kicking off the battle of domestic AI competing with the world. From being monopolized externally to self-developed design, it ultimately broke through ChatGPT’s model costs, rivaled them, and served as a domestic LLM alternative — the first vendor to open-source a large language model… Every moment is a source of pride for the Chinese people.</p>

<p>From what DeepSeek’s CEO posted, I got two things</p>

<ul>
  <li>
    <ol>
      <li>Being followed is very fulfilling</li>
    </ol>
  </li>
  <li>
    <ol>
      <li>What the garage spirit is</li>
    </ol>
  </li>
</ul>

<blockquote>
  <p>The last person I thought had both of the above was Jobs, right? Even Musk, as wealthy as he is, doesn’t have both.</p>
